	When we placed our personal orders, everyone on the team grabbed one of the two shadow plaid workshirts. They're custom plaid pitches you aren't going to find anywhere else in the two distinct seasonal colors, kelly green and raspberry. Both feature a double side brushed flannel with a soft hand feel.
